"""Relay — a durable memory + operations layer for an agent that works a CRM.

The agent (OpenCode) is the brain and the browser (Browse MCP) is the hands.
Relay keeps the part that must survive a context window: who the customer is,
what was promised, what is overdue, what was already said, and an audit trail.

Only stdlib. Data lives in SQLite (default ./data/relay.db).
"""

